{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq87ubxn2d4","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"Loop bootstrap race: session-bound loop_start is swept dead before first spawn","summary":"Finding (2026-06-10): loop_start({session}) registers the loop, but sessionIsLive() in daemon.js only counts running agents or fresh in_progress claims — a brand-new loop has neither, so the first next_action tick's sweepStaleLoops() demotes it (\"driving session dead\") and the heartbeat sees an empty registry. Workaround: restart the loop in place without a session binding (empty session ⇒ live by definition; loses cooperative-stop, keeps hard token/iteration caps). Proper fix: bootstrap grace window keyed off startedAt/lastProgress before applying the session-dead rule.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-10T15:20:52.715Z","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:01:05.747Z"}
{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq87ubxn2d4","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"Loop bootstrap race: session-bound loop_start is swept dead before first spawn","summary":"Finding (2026-06-10): loop_start({session}) registers the loop, but sessionIsLive() in daemon.js only counts running agents or fresh in_progress claims — a brand-new loop has neither, so the first next_action tick's sweepStaleLoops() demotes it (\"driving session dead\") and the heartbeat sees an empty registry. Workaround: restart the loop in place without a session binding (empty session ⇒ live by definition; loses cooperative-stop, keeps hard token/iteration caps). Proper fix: bootstrap grace window keyed off startedAt/lastProgress before applying the session-dead rule.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-10T15:20:52.715Z","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:08:57.822Z"}
